From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 10:02:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] content: plain-language operator UI + landing; clearer nav
 labels
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace jargon with wording a canteen operator understands:
- Kitchen Control: 'Throughput' -> 'Kitchen Speed'; 'MAPE' -> 'Avg off by';
  'ETA model' -> plain wait-time language
- Morning Prep: drop MAPE / Edge Function / cron; simplify model card
- Ingredients (was Inventory): 'Burn/min' -> 'Used/min'; 'Below reorder' -> 'Running low'
- Kitchen Display: 'Supabase Realtime'/'Polling' -> plain live/auto-refresh text
- Analytics: 'Avg ticket' -> 'Avg order value'; fix mismatched Cancelled subtext
- Menu Stock (was Stock): 'Stock/Cap' -> 'Left/Max'
- Landing + operator login: drop Supabase Realtime / hybrid recommender / KDS / ML jargon
- Nav: dedupe 📦 icon, clearer labels (Menu Stock, Ingredients, Kitchen Settings)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WAaG9KM1L8CvDwQDSiPi1q
